  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cultural Emergency Response, subsidy request 2025-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The financial contribution of the Dutch Government enables the international NGO Cultural Emergency Response to protect cultural heritage under threat for a four-year period (2025-2028). 

Since 2022 CER is an independent organization, before it was part of the Prince Claus Fund. CER is the only organization in The Netherlands, and one of few internationally, providing first aid to protect culture in crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
